BT /F1 8 Tf 50 34 Td (Simple-language study guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 500 34 Td (Page 1 of 7) Tj ET
BT /F2 25 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 775 Tm (SmartNote AI) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 739 Tm (Project explained in simple language | Evaluation and viva) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 720 Tm (preparation guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 12 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 699 Tm (Based on the project source code) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 674 Tm (START HERE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 649 Tm (This guide explains what the application does, how its parts work together, what the code) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 637 Tm (  files are responsible for, and how to answer common evaluation questions. Learn the flow) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 625 Tm (  first, then use the viva section to practise explaining details.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 604 Tm (PROJECT OVERVIEW) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 579 Tm (SmartNote AI is a web application that helps a student turn lecture PDFs into study material.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 567 Tm (  It extracts text from a PDF, presents the pages in a browser, and can prepare notes,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 555 Tm (  important topics, practice questions, and a chat assistant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 538 Tm (The project uses a Python server for processing and a browser interface for interacting with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 526 Tm (  the result. Gemini is an optional cloud AI service for generating study content. Some) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 514 Tm (  document-analysis features have local fallback logic when Gemini is unavailable.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 493 Tm (What problem does it solve?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 473 Tm (Students often have long lecture documents and limited time to organize them. SmartNote) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 461 Tm (  automates first-draft summaries and revision materials, and gives the student a place to ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 449 Tm (  questions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 428 Tm (One-sentence summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 408 Tm (SmartNote AI is a FastAPI-based study assistant that extracts lecture PDF text and turns it) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 396 Tm (  into browser-based notes, topic maps, practice material, and Gemini chat.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 375 Tm (HOW THE WHOLE PROJECT WORKS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 350 Tm (Think of the system as four stages: upload, extract, generate, and display.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 333 Tm (- 1. Upload: the student selects a PDF in the web page. The browser sends it to the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 321 Tm (  FastAPI server.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 307 Tm (- 2. Extract: PyMuPDF reads each page and extracts text blocks. The processor records) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 295 Tm (  page numbers, headings, word counts, and the total text.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 281 Tm (- 3. Generate: the AI service uses Gemini when available. Notes, topics, and practice) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 269 Tm (  features have local heuristic fallbacks. Chat uses Gemini directly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 255 Tm (- 4. Display: the API returns JSON. JavaScript updates the page with notes, topic cards,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 243 Tm (  a mindmap, practice activities, or the chat reply.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 225 Tm (Simple architecture) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 205 Tm (Student browser -> static HTML/CSS/JavaScript -> FastAPI routes) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 192 Tm (                                      |) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 179 Tm (                         PDFProcessor -> extracted text/pages/chunks) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 166 Tm (                                      |) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 153 Tm (                       AIService -> Gemini or local fallbacks) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 140 Tm (                                      |) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 127 Tm (                          JSON response -> browser display) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 114 Tm (The browser and server communicate using HTTP requests. Most requests and responses use JSON;) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 102 Tm (  PDF upload uses a multipart file request.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 81 Tm (TECHNOLOGIES USED) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
