BT /F1 8 Tf 50 34 Td (Simple-language study guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 500 34 Td (Page 2 of 7) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 775 Tm (- Python: main programming language for the server and document-processing logic.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 761 Tm (- FastAPI: defines the HTTP API endpoints and serves the web application.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 747 Tm (- PyMuPDF \(fitz\): opens PDFs and extracts text page by page.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 733 Tm (- Google GenAI SDK: sends prompts to the configured Gemini model.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 719 Tm (- scikit-learn and NumPy: used by the TF-IDF retrieval engine.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 705 Tm (- HTML: defines the page structure; CSS styles it; JavaScript handles user interaction) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 693 Tm (  and API calls.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 679 Tm (- Pydantic: checks the shape of incoming API request data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 665 Tm (- python-dotenv: reads local settings such as the API key from a .env file.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 647 Tm (Why separate the project into services?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 627 Tm (Each part has a clear job. main.py handles web requests, pdf_processor.py handles PDFs,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 615 Tm (  ai_service.py creates AI study content, and rag_engine.py handles text retrieval) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 603 Tm (  experiments. This makes the code easier to understand and test than putting every task in) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 591 Tm (  one file.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 570 Tm (PDF PROCESSING: FROM PAGES TO TEXT) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 545 Tm (The PDFProcessor in services/pdf_processor.py opens a file, checks its pages, and extracts) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 533 Tm (  text blocks. For each page it stores the page number, text, blocks, headings, and word and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 521 Tm (  character counts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 504 Tm (The processor also creates a document title from PDF metadata or, if that is missing, from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 492 Tm (  file name. It calculates an approximate reading time using about 200 words per minute.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 471 Tm (What is a chunk?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 451 Tm (A chunk is a smaller piece of extracted text. The processor groups paragraphs into pieces of) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 439 Tm (  roughly 800 characters and overlaps the end of one piece with the beginning of the next.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 427 Tm (  Overlap helps avoid losing context when a concept crosses a chunk boundary. Each chunk has) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 415 Tm (  an ID, page number, and text.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 398 Tm (If the PDF is a scan containing only pictures, ordinary text extraction may find little or no) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 386 Tm (  text. This project does not perform optical character recognition \(OCR\), so scanned pages) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 374 Tm (  may need OCR before useful notes can be generated.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 353 Tm (Why preserve page numbers?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 333 Tm (Page metadata helps show where extracted content came from and makes it easier to relate study) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 321 Tm (  material back to the original lecture. In the current implementation, the direct Gemini chat) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 309 Tm (  does not use these chunks or cite their page numbers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 288 Tm (AI FEATURES AND FALLBACKS) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 259 Tm (Structured notes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 239 Tm (AIService.generate_structured_notes sends the lecture text, title, and page information to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 227 Tm (  Gemini and asks for a study guide with summaries, concepts, definitions, exam traps, and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 215 Tm (  revision sheet. The Gemini prompt limits the text sent to about 350,000 characters. If) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 203 Tm (  Gemini is unavailable or fails, a local structural note generator is used.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 182 Tm (Important topics) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 162 Tm (AIService.extract_important_topics asks Gemini to return topics, priority levels,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 150 Tm (  descriptions, page references, prerequisites, and mindmap data in JSON. It limits input to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 138 Tm (  about 300,000 characters. If the call or JSON parsing fails, a local heuristic topic) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 126 Tm (  extractor is used.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 105 Tm (Practice questions) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
