BT /F1 8 Tf 50 34 Td (Simple-language study guide) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 500 34 Td (Page 3 of 7) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 775 Tm (AIService.generate_practice_questions requests multiple-choice questions, flashcards, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 763 Tm (  short-answer questions from Gemini, including answers and page references. The input is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 751 Tm (  limited to about 300,000 characters. If Gemini fails, local heuristic generation supplies) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 739 Tm (  practice content.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 718 Tm (Chat question and answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 698 Tm (AIService.answer_question sends the latest student question and up to eight recent chat) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (  messages to Gemini. It is not limited to the uploaded PDF. It returns an answer and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 674 Tm (  suggested follow-up questions. It returns no PDF citations. If no Gemini key is configured,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 662 Tm (  or the Gemini request fails, the API reports an error instead of pretending an offline) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 650 Tm (  answer came from Gemini.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 629 Tm (What does fallback mean here?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 609 Tm (A fallback is a simpler local method used when a cloud AI request cannot complete. It can keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 597 Tm (  notes, topics, and practice features available, but its results may be less flexible than) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 585 Tm (  Gemini. Chat currently has no local fallback.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 564 Tm (RAG: IMPORTANT EVALUATION DISTINCTION) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 539 Tm (RAG means Retrieval-Augmented Generation. A typical RAG system first searches a document for) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 527 Tm (  relevant passages, then gives those passages to a language model to help answer a question.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 510 Tm (This project contains a RAGEngine in services/rag_engine.py. It converts document chunks into) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 498 Tm (  TF-IDF vectors and uses cosine similarity to rank chunks against a search query. TF-IDF) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 486 Tm (  gives more weight to terms that are informative within the document; cosine similarity) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 474 Tm (  compares the direction of the query vector with each chunk vector.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 457 Tm (However, the current production chat route does not call rag_engine.search or build a PDF) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 445 Tm (  context prompt. It sends the chat question and conversation history directly to Gemini. PDF) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 433 Tm (  extraction still creates chunks, but the active chat answer is general Gemini chat, not PDF-) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 421 Tm (  grounded RAG.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 404 Tm (The system test separately indexes a sample document and checks that retrieval works. That) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 392 Tm (  proves the retrieval component can be tested; it does not mean the live chat endpoint is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 380 Tm (  using retrieval.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 359 Tm (Short evaluation answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 339 Tm (The project has a TF-IDF and cosine-similarity RAG component, but the current chat feature is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 327 Tm (  not RAG. It calls Gemini directly without retrieving PDF excerpts.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 306 Tm (MAIN SOURCE FILES) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 281 Tm (- main.py: creates the FastAPI application, request models, routes, document storage,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 269 Tm (  startup cleanup, and static-file serving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 255 Tm (- services/pdf_processor.py: extracts text and metadata from PDF pages and creates text) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 243 Tm (  chunks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 229 Tm (- services/ai_service.py: generates notes, topics, and practice using Gemini or local) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 217 Tm (  fallbacks; handles direct Gemini chat.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 203 Tm (- services/rag_engine.py: indexes chunks with TF-IDF and retrieves similar chunks with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 191 Tm (  cosine similarity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 177 Tm (- static/index.html: defines the user interface layout and feature tabs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 163 Tm (- static/app.js: handles uploads, calls API routes, updates the interface, and stores) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 151 Tm (  chat history in browser memory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 137 Tm (- static/style.css: controls colors, layout, responsive styling, and animations.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 123 Tm (- config.py: loads the .env file, API key, model name, port, and local data folders.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 109 Tm (- test_system.py: runs component-level and end-to-end-style checks, including PDF) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 97 Tm (  extraction, RAG retrieval, fallbacks, and mocked Gemini chat.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 83 Tm (- test_api.py: exercises HTTP routes through FastAPI TestClient and mocks Gemini for chat) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 71 Tm (  tests.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
