BT /F1 8 Tf 500 34 Td (Page 4 of 7) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 775 Tm (- .env: local configuration for the key and model. It should stay private and must not be) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 763 Tm (  committed or shared.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 745 Tm (IMPORTANT API ROUTES) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 720 Tm (- GET /api/status: reports whether a Gemini key is configured and which model is) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 708 Tm (  selected.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 694 Tm (- POST /api/config/key: accepts a key through the settings interface and can save it into) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 682 Tm (  .env.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (- POST /api/upload: accepts a PDF, extracts its text, and stores document data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 654 Tm (- GET /api/document/{doc_id}: returns the document overview and generated materials.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 640 Tm (- POST /api/generate-notes/{doc_id}: creates structured notes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 626 Tm (- POST /api/generate-topics/{doc_id}: creates prioritized topics and mindmap data.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 612 Tm (- POST /api/generate-practice/{doc_id}: creates quizzes, flashcards, and short-answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 600 Tm (  questions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 586 Tm (- POST /api/generate-all/{doc_id}: runs notes, topics, and practice generation) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 574 Tm (  sequentially.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 560 Tm (- POST /api/chat: sends a question and chat history to Gemini; it does not require a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 548 Tm (  document ID.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 534 Tm (- GET /api/export/{doc_id}/markdown and /html: export generated notes as Markdown or) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 522 Tm (  printable HTML.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 508 Tm (The {doc_id} part is a placeholder for the ID returned after uploading a document. The API) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 496 Tm (  returns status codes: for example, 200 means success, 404 means a requested resource was not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 484 Tm (  found, 503 means chat is not configured, and 502 means the Gemini request failed.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 463 Tm (CONFIGURATION, STORAGE, AND LIFECYCLE) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 438 Tm (config.py loads the local .env file and reads GEMINI_API_KEY, DEFAULT_MODEL, and PORT. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 426 Tm (  .env file is ignored by Git in this project, which helps keep secrets out of source control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 414 Tm (  Never paste an API key into screenshots, chats, or a public repository. If a key has been) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 402 Tm (  exposed, revoke it and create a replacement.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 385 Tm (Uploaded PDFs are written to uploads/ and parsed document data is written to data/ as JSON.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 373 Tm (  The app also keeps active documents in a Python dictionary in memory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 356 Tm (Important lifecycle behavior: on server startup, main.py clears saved PDFs and JSON files.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 344 Tm (  Therefore documents are not restored across a server restart. This is a current) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 332 Tm (  implementation detail, not durable long-term storage.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 315 Tm (The browser keeps chat history in JavaScript memory and sends a small recent slice with each) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 303 Tm (  new question. Refreshing the page clears that chat history.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 282 Tm (TESTING AND QUALITY CHECKS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 257 Tm (Run the system test with the project Python environment: python test_system.py. It creates a) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 245 Tm (  sample PDF, extracts text, checks chunk retrieval, exercises note/topic/practice generation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 233 Tm (  and mocks Gemini for the direct chat check.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 216 Tm (The chat test uses a mock response, so it checks prompt construction and API wiring without) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 204 Tm (  making a real Gemini request. A successful mocked test does not prove that the configured) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 192 Tm (  key or model is accepted by Google.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 175 Tm (For a live integration check, confirm /api/status reports Gemini configured, verify the exact) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 163 Tm (  model is available to the key, then send one short chat question. Avoid sending the actual) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 151 Tm (  key in logs or evaluation material.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 130 Tm (What should tests cover?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 110 Tm (- PDF extraction: correct page count, text, and chunk page labels.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 96 Tm (- Fallbacks: notes, topics, and practice return useful shapes with no API key.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 82 Tm (- Chat: sends user history, handles empty Gemini replies, and returns a clear error if) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 70 Tm (  Gemini fails.) Tj ET
endstream
