BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 745 Tm (STRENGTHS AND LIMITATIONS) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 716 Tm (Strengths) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 696 Tm (- The code is divided into manageable parts and has an automated test script.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 682 Tm (- Page-level extraction and chunk metadata make the source PDF easier to inspect.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 668 Tm (- Local generation fallbacks let several study features run without a working Gemini) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 656 Tm (  call.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 642 Tm (- The UI brings notes, topics, quizzes, flashcards, exports, and chat together.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 624 Tm (Limitations to discuss honestly) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 604 Tm (- The active chat is not grounded in the uploaded PDF and does not cite its pages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 590 Tm (- Scanned PDFs need OCR, which is not implemented in the current processor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 576 Tm (- Document files are cleared at server startup, and browser chat history is not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 564 Tm (  persistent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 550 Tm (- Cloud AI requires an available model, a valid key, network access, and available quota.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 538 Tm (  A configured key alone does not guarantee successful requests.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 524 Tm (- The one-click generate-all endpoint runs the generations one after another, which can) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 512 Tm (  take time.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 498 Tm (- Generated content may be incomplete or incorrect and should be checked against the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 486 Tm (  lecture.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 468 Tm (EVALUATION / VIVA QUESTIONS AND ANSWERS) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 443 Tm (1. What is the main purpose of SmartNote AI?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 426 Tm (It extracts lecture text from PDFs and helps students create notes, topic lists, practice) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 414 Tm (  questions, and AI chat answers.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 400 Tm (2. What is FastAPI doing in this project?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 383 Tm (It runs the backend web server, defines HTTP endpoints, validates request data, and returns) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 371 Tm (  results to the browser.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 357 Tm (3. How does the project read a PDF?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 340 Tm (PDFProcessor uses PyMuPDF to extract text blocks from each page, preserve page details, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 328 Tm (  create smaller text chunks.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 314 Tm (4. What is the difference between the frontend and backend?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 297 Tm (The frontend is the browser interface made from HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The backend is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 285 Tm (  Python server that processes files and calls AI services.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 271 Tm (5. What is a REST API endpoint?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 254 Tm (It is a URL and HTTP method that lets the frontend request a specific operation, such as POST) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 242 Tm (  /api/upload to upload a PDF.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 228 Tm (6. What is Gemini used for?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 211 Tm (Gemini can create study notes, topics, and practice content from extracted text and answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 199 Tm (  general chat questions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 185 Tm (7. Does the current chat use RAG?) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 168 Tm (No. The project has a TF-IDF retrieval engine, but the live chat route sends the question and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 156 Tm (  recent history directly to Gemini without PDF retrieval.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 142 Tm (8. Explain TF-IDF and cosine similarity simply.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 125 Tm (TF-IDF gives words a numerical importance based on how often they occur in a passage and how) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 113 Tm (  uncommon they are in the document. Cosine similarity compares the query vector with passage) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 101 Tm (  vectors to rank similar passages.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 50 87 Tm (9. What is a fallback?) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
